## Scope & Summary

The file is a small Express application with two endpoints (`/health`, `/users`) and a server bound to port 3000. While the surface area is small, there are several real security concerns plus missing baseline hardening that would matter the moment this app grows. Below I've mapped findings to OWASP Top 10 categories with specific remediations.

