## Overview

`app.js` is a minimal Express application with two endpoints (`/health`, `/users`) listening on port 3000. While the surface area is small, there are several real security concerns and a number of best-practice gaps that will become critical the moment this app grows. I'll go through them organized by OWASP Top 10 category.

