### 5. No CORS Policy Defined (OWASP A05 – Security Misconfiguration)

Without an explicit CORS configuration, browsers apply the same-origin policy by default, but as soon as someone adds `cors()` carelessly (e.g., `app.use(cors())` with default wildcard), the app becomes accessible from any origin. Set a deliberate policy now.

