  // Log full error server-side only
  console.error({ msg: 'unhandled', err: err.stack, path: req.path });
  res.status(500).json({ error: 'Internal server error' });
});
```

Also add structured request logging (e.g., `pino-http`) so authentication failures, 4xx spikes, etc. are observable — currently nothing is logged.

